  "notes": [
    "Shared datasheet 'FA-238(V), TSX-3225 Series'; this document encodes only the 'For RF Reference' column (TSX-3225), not the 'For Clock' FA-238/FA-238V columns.",
    "The physical package has 4 pads: #1 and #3 are the two crystal (XTAL) terminals; #2 and #4 are connected to the metal cover and must be connected to ground (they are not resonator terminals).",
    "Load capacitance is order-specified as '7 pF to infinity'; 8 pF was chosen as a representative finite (parallel-resonant) value. A series-resonant order (CL = infinity) would omit load_capacitance and set RESONANCE = series.",
    "C0 (shunt capacitance), C1 (motional capacitance), Q, and insulation resistance are not printed on this Epson sheet and are therefore omitted rather than invented."
  ]
